From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000001 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] platform/x86: oxpec: Use data-driven EC profiles

The board enum is currently used by several switch statements to select
fan registers, PWM ranges, turbo controls, turbo LED support and charge
controls. Store those values in a profile table indexed by the existing
enum instead.

Keep the enum values and DMI table unchanged so this is a mechanical
refactor with no intended functional change.

Signed-off-by: Xiao Han <hanxiao@live.com>
---
 drivers/platform/x86/oxpec.c | 260 ++++++++++++++++++-----------------
 1 file changed, 134 insertions(+), 126 deletions(-)

